## Summary
Brazilian President Lula is seeking to establish direct contact with Donald Trump in an effort to bypass US Secretary of State Marco Rubio. According to CNN, Lula views Rubio as 'anti-Latin America' and aims to 'neutralize' his influence on US-Brazil relations.

## Key Points
- Lula is attempting to establish direct communication channels with Trump
- Lula seeks to bypass Secretary of State Marco Rubio in diplomatic dealings
- Lula characterized Rubio as 'anti-Latin America'
- The strategy reflects strained relations between Brazil and the current US administration's diplomatic apparatus


